    "source_text": " phenylmethanamine (0.111 mL, 1.01 mmol), 2,4-dichloropyridine (0.151 mL, 1.01 mmol), 4,5-bis(diphenylphosphino)-9,9-dimethylxanthene (70.4 mg, 0.12 mmol) and cesium carbonate (660 mg, 2.03 mmol) were stirred in 1,4-dioxane (5 mL). The mixture was purged with nitrogen for 10 minutes. Palladium(II) acetate (22.76 mg, 0.10 mmol) was added and sealed into a microwave tube. The reaction was heated to 100 °C for 1 hour in the microwave reactor and cooled to RT. The reaction was heated to 100 °C for 1 hour in the microwave reactor and cooled to RT.  ",
